   "text": "Pace University - Pathway - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nPace University - Pathway\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLocated in one of the world’s top academic cities (QS Best Student Cities 2018), Pace University is an exciting setting for students to begin their US university degree. Students benefit from small classes and specialized preparation to help them succeed on an American campus. Pace's New York campus is located just minutes from Wall Street, the World Trade Center, and the Brooklyn Bridge.For international student's seeking a top tier university in one of the most dynamic cities in the world, Pace University is a great option. Both pathway and direct admission options are available for international students.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:36\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:31\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$39,000.00\nMin: US$13,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n1,451 of 13,312 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1906\nCampus(es)\nNew York\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nUnited States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available for international students\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available for international students\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tEmNylC8voE\nInternship Details\nInternship available for international students\nAdditional Information\n-",
